From 7291867a82a88027c00b6ddedc01c9637a53b549 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Ceccarelli Grimaldi <vince.ceccarelli@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 20:06:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(site): mixed-SKU palletizer is the product; five-item
 IA; parked routes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Home: kicker, H1 (EN/DE), physics line, live stack planner with the
  sample SSR-stacked, honesty line (software shipped | cell not
  commissioned), three doors, SKU/layout intake. No price, no calendar,
  no newsletter on home or header.
- New routes: /palletizer (planner + adapter table), /integrators
  (who supplies what, two robots, controller diagram), /docs (CSV, units,
  scoring, codes, IDLE/RUN/HOLD/FAULT), /work (no commissioned cell
  published), /contact (same intake). /book -> /contact,
  /forge/palletizer -> /palletizer (308).
- lib/mixedsku.ts: deterministic layer packer, base-support + centre-of-mass
  stability, crush-limit faults by SKU, URScript stub and CSV export.
- /api/intake: multipart intake forwarded to INTAKE_WEBHOOK_URL; honest
  503 + fallback address when unconfigured; JS-off path via 303 + fragment.
- lib/nav.ts: Product · Integrators · Tools · Work · Contact. Forge, lab,
  disciplines, solutions, pricing, resources, about and the motor/battery/
  control calculators stay at HTTP 200, noindex, unlinked.
- Design: paper/ink/signal tokens, IBM Plex Sans + Mono self-hosted (OFL),
  8 px grid, radius 4/2, reduced-motion respected. No purple, no gradients.
- vercel.json: keep security headers and www->apex; add 308 rules for
  /book, /forge/palletizer and a host rule so palletizer-app.vercel.app can
  later point at /palletizer. Datenschutz updated for the intake.
- Remove applied *.patch files from the tree (already gitignored).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016HD3VVJ8vLCwjk4R5NThap
